---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="works-overview">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section">
      <TitleLv2 title="プロジェクト概要" />
      <div class="l-section-body">
        <dl class="works-overview-list">
          <div class="works-overview-item">
            <dt class="works-overview-term">サイト名</dt>
            <dd class="works-overview-description">koyomi yoga pilates</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="works-overview-item">
            <dt class="works-overview-term">業種</dt>
            <dd class="works-overview-description">ヨガ・ピラティススタジオ</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="works-overview-item">
            <dt class="works-overview-term">サイト種別</dt>
            <dd class="works-overview-description">サービスサイト</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="works-overview-item">
            <dt class="works-overview-term">ターゲット</dt>
            <dd class="works-overview-description">
              いつまでも健康で洗練された身体と心を目指したい女性
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p class="works-overview-text">
          埼玉県所沢市のヨガ・ピラティスタジオ「koyomi yoga pilates」様のサービスサイト。<br>
          開業・新規集客に向けて、予約導線を重視したホームページを制作しました。
        </p>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../../styles/breakpoints" as *;

  .works-overview-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .works-overview-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr;
    gap: min(32px, calc(32 / var(--width-sp) * 100vw));
  }

  .works-overview-term {
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .works-overview-text {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-block-start: 32px;
  }

  @include mq() {
    .works-overview-item {
      grid-template-columns: 102px 1fr;
      gap: 72px;
    }

    .works-overview-term {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .works-overview-text {
      margin-block-start: 34px;
    }
  }
</style>
